      "question": "What caused the settlement shortfall on the Aurelia Home Decor account in March 2026, and how large was it?",
      "category": "authorized_factual",
      "expected_behavior": "answer",
      "actual_behavior": "answer",
      "status": "FAIL",
      "answer": "**Cause**  \nThe March 2026 settlement shortfall was caused by a **deduplication‑key defect in the settlement ledger** that was introduced during a schema migration. This defect caused each of the 1,914 reversal entries to be recorded twice, resulting in a double deduction (see Scenario SC‑001)【Account Overview S001-ACC-001】.  \n\n**Amount**  \nThe shortfall amounted to **INR 4,82,000**【Account Overview S001-ACC-001】.\n\nSources:\n- Account Overview S001-ACC-001 - Pages 1, 3, 4\n- Support Ticket TKT-2026-0312-114 - Page 1\n- Call Transcript CALL-2026-0313-018",
